this is an example template with placeholder values 
to know what they need to fill in:

DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432(or whichever port number your local postgresql is using)
DB_NAME=medtracker
DB_USER=postgres
DB_PASSWORD=your_password_here
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your_key_here
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_here

....this is an example of you .env file
